entscheidungen.entscheidung:
Keep the canvas orthographic dot globe and upgrade it:
- real coastlines from Natural Earth 110m (world-atlas@2 land-110m.json), rasterised once at 0.25° into a run-length-encoded mask committed as src/modules/weltkarte.py and served from /api/weltkarte;
- dot density chosen by zoom;
- eased fly-to transitions with zoom 1 to 6;
- HUD crosshair, coordinates, news markers, great-circle arcs.

Vapi is the default:
- POST /call, poll GET /call/{id} every 1.5 s, hang up via monitor.controlUrl;
- transcript and structured result after the call;
- the in-call model is Vapi's 'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001' (configurable as VAPI_MODELL), Azure German voice, Deepgram nova-3 'de', recordingEnabled false, at most 4 minutes, AI disclosure in the first sentence.
Retell is optional (TELEFONAGENT_ANBIETER=retell): an outbound WSS monitor gives a real live transcript of both sides. After the call, Claude only PROPOSES the calendar entry; termin_anlegen still asks for approval.

Keyless and tested:
- tagesschau api2u (at most 50 calls per hour, cached);
- Google News RSS search and section feeds;
- Deutsche Welle RDF as fallback;
- Yahoo v8 spark with User-Agent exactly 'Mozilla/5.0';
- CoinGecko and the ECB EUR/USD rate as fallbacks.
Every item carries source and time; failures are listed by name; caches are 10 min for news and 60 s for prices. Stooq is not used.
